      "writtenOn": "2021-10-20T01:09:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this is a good point, the intention was to allow older boards to update to new RO versions with RO_GSCVD areas present.\n\nMaintaining an ever growing list of included board IDs does not seem practical. We can add another indicator of the impending cache erase/update, this way even if power is interrupted after erase before the update we\u0027d know that this device is supposed to run verification.\n\nLet\u0027s discuss this further on the tracker.",
      "parentUuid": "58233dc2_64c73c71",
